Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.94,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,615)\fad(150,250)}10 diferenças
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Antes de começar, um combinado: tudo o que eu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:29.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,falar sobre GTA 6 vem dos trailers, do vídeo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.97,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de gameplay e do site oficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:34.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na quinta, com o jogo na mão, a gente confere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,o que se confirmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:38.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Bora para a lista.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:41.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E fica até o fim, porque a diferença número
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:44.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,dez mexe com quem joga GTA Online há anos.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.35,0:00:28.00,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
