Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.85,0:03:27.56,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}4. A ÁGUA
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.52,0:03:10.12,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}METADE DO MAPA
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.72,0:03:10.12,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}pântano, canais, marinas e ilhas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:30.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Diferença número cinco: as redes sociais.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:34.04,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 5 já brincava com isso, com a Lifeinvader,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,a paródia do Facebook, e o Bleeter, a paródia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:40.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mas era coisa de menu no celular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:43.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers de GTA 6, os vídeos verticais de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:46.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,rede social estão por toda parte: gente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:49.14,Legenda,,0,0,0,,filmando briga, dancinha, perseguição e
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:49.77,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jacaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A internet virou parte do mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:55.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E faz sentido: a Flórida é famosa justamente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pelos vídeos absurdos que circulam na
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:58.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:01.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Rockstar pegou essa fama e colocou dentro do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:02.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,jogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ainda não se sabe se você vai poder postar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,seus próprios vídeos, mas o mundo de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:09.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,claramente está sempre filmando.
