Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.38,0:04:50.98,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}GROTTI CHEETAH
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.58,0:04:50.98,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}de volta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:08.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Diferença número oito: os animais.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:12.02,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 5 tinha cachorro, puma, tubarão e até a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,vaca no meio da estrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 aposta no que a Flórida tem de mais
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,famoso: jacaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:21.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No pântano, na estrada e, sim, dentro de loja
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:24.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de conveniência, igual àqueles vídeos reais
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,que viralizam todo ano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:28.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os trailers também mostram cervos, iguanas e
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pássaros por todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:34.13,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em GTA 5, os animais eram quase decoração.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:37.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em Leonida, eles parecem fazer parte do caos
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:38.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do dia a dia.
